    Regression input for the read path: the wireEdge:curveType/range/vertexIndices
    attribute family is entirely ABSENT (legal - shell:wireEdgeCount is zero, so the
    family is conditionally not required). The reader must read these as empty, not
    abort the brep. Derived from the OpenUSD-fork fixture testCylinder.usda by
    deleting the three authored-empty wireEdge attributes.
